<title>INDONESIA: TENNIS-NEW ZEALAND BEAT INDONESIA IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NEW ZEALAND BEAT INDONESIA IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand beat Indonesia in Saturday's doubles match to take an unbeatable 3-0 lead in their Davis Cup Asia/Oceania zone group one, second round tie.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>James Greenhalgh/Alastair Hunt beat Bonit Wiryawan/Sulistyo Wibowo 6-3 6-4 3-6 6-3</p>
